EX-Proton: protonfixes, Vulkan low-latency layer and PROTON_FSR4_UPGRADE.

Adds build rules for umu-protonfixes and Korthos low_latency_layer (both
following Proton-GE's rules, built only when scripts/prepare.sh cloned the
sources) and the launcher hooks: protonfixes is imported and run like in
Proton-GE, LOW_LATENCY_LAYER=1 enables the layer, and PROTON_FSR4_UPGRADE=1
has protonfixes fetch the FSR4 DLL for Wine's existing amdxc64 upgrade path.

Written for EX-Proton; applies after 0001 and 0002.

